---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="How it Works | EV Kelly Calculator"
  description="A technical breakdown of the mathematics and variance models powering the EV Kelly optimization engine."
>
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto w-full min-h-screen px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-16 lg:px-24 pt-12 md:pt-20 pb-24">
    
    <header class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mx-auto mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <h1 class="animate-reveal text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-[var(--theme-text-main)] mb-4" style="opacity: 0;">
        How to Use the Calculator
      </h1>
      <p class="animate-reveal delay-100 text-lg sm:text-xl text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] font-medium max-w-2xl leading-relaxed" style="opacity: 0;">
        A step-by-step mechanical guide to inputting your trade data and reading the quantitative outputs.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 sm:gap-12 relative">
      
      <div class="liquid-panel static-panel w-full p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-10 items-start">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[var(--theme-input-bg)] border border-[var(--liquid-input-border)] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold text-[var(--theme-accent-blue)] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(10,132,255,0.2)]">
          1
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--theme-text-main)] tracking-tight">Input Your Core Parameters</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
            Locate the <strong>Parameters</strong> panel on the left side of the dashboard. You must input four specific metrics based on your historical trading data:
          </p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4 mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--theme-text-muted)]">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--theme-accent-blue)] flex-shrink-0 mt-1.5"></span> 
              <span class="leading-relaxed">
                <strong class="text-[var(--theme-text-main)] block sm:inline sm:mr-1">Trade Win Rate (%):</strong> 
                Your historical percentage of winning trades.
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--theme-accent-blue)] flex-shrink-0 mt-1.5"></span> 
              <span class="leading-relaxed">
                <strong class="text-[var(--theme-text-main)] block sm:inline sm:mr-1">Reward-to-Risk Ratio:</strong> 
                Your average winning trade divided by your average losing trade.
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--theme-accent-blue)] flex-shrink-0 mt-1.5"></span> 
              <span class="leading-relaxed">
                <strong class="text-[var(--theme-text-main)] block sm:inline sm:mr-1">Total Capital ($):</strong> 
                The total liquid bankroll you are dedicating to this strategy.
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--theme-accent-blue)] flex-shrink-0 mt-1.5"></span> 
              <span class="leading-relaxed">
                <strong class="text-[var(--theme-text-main)] block sm:inline sm:mr-1">Stop Loss Limit (%):</strong> 
                The maximum portfolio drawdown you are willing to tolerate before halting trading.
              </span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="liquid-panel static-panel w-full p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-10 items-start">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[var(--theme-input-bg)] border border-[var(--liquid-input-border)] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold text-[var(--theme-accent-green)] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(48,209,88,0.2)]">
          2
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--theme-text-main)] tracking-tight">Verify the Expected Value (EV)</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
            Once you click <strong>Calculate Edge</strong>, check the Expected Value output box. If the number is <span class="text-[var(--theme-accent-red)] font-bold">Red</span> and negative, stop immediately—your strategy loses money over time. If the number is <span class="text-[var(--theme-accent-green)] font-bold">Green</span> and positive, proceed to size your positions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="liquid-panel static-panel w-full p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-10 items-start">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[var(--theme-input-bg)] border border-[var(--liquid-input-border)] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold text-white shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]">
          3
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--theme-text-main)] tracking-tight">Select Your Fractional Kelly Size</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
            The dashboard calculates three distinct position sizes based on your total capital:
          </p>
          <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--theme-text-muted)]">
            <li class="bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.03)] p-3 rounded-lg border border-[var(--liquid-input-border)]">
              <strong class="text-[var(--theme-accent-blue)]">Full Kelly:</strong> The maximum mathematical size. Generates the highest returns but causes massive account volatility.
            </li>
            <li class="bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.03)] p-3 rounded-lg border border-[var(--liquid-input-border)]">
              <strong class="text-[var(--theme-accent-green)]">Half Kelly:</strong> The industry standard. Risks 50% of the Full Kelly amount, drastically smoothing the equity curve while retaining high growth.
            </li>
            <li class="bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.03)] p-3 rounded-lg border border-[var(--liquid-input-border)]">
              <strong class="text-white">Quarter Kelly:</strong> The institutional standard. The safest sizing tier, recommended for unproven algorithms or manual traders protecting capital.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="liquid-panel static-panel w-full p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 md:gap-10 items-start">
        <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[var(--theme-input-bg)] border border-[var(--liquid-input-border)] flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold text-[var(--theme-accent-red)] shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(255,69,58,0.2)]">
          4
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--theme-text-main)] tracking-tight">Review Risk of Ruin & Growth Projections</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
            Examine the <strong>Risk of Ruin</strong> percentage. This defines the exact probability of hitting your Stop Loss Limit if you trade the Full Kelly size. 
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
            Finally, review the <strong>Growth Expectancy Chart</strong>. This graph maps the median theoretical compounding trajectory of your bankroll across 100 consecutive trades, allowing you to visually compare the volatility of Full, Half, and Quarter Kelly position sizes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "HowTo",
  "name": "How to Use the EV Kelly Calculator",
  "description": "A step-by-step guide to inputting your historical trade data into the EV Kelly Calculator to determine your exact mathematical edge and optimal position sizing.",
  "step": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Input Your Core Parameters",
      "text": "Locate the Parameters panel and input your Trade Win Rate, Reward-to-Risk Ratio, Total Capital, and Stop Loss Limit based on your historical trading data."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Verify the Expected Value (EV)",
      "text": "Click Calculate Edge and verify that your Expected Value is positive. If it is negative, your strategy loses money over time."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Select Your Fractional Kelly Size",
      "text": "Review the Full, Half, and Quarter Kelly position sizes. Choose Quarter or Half Kelly for a smoother equity curve with lower variance."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "Review Risk of Ruin & Growth Projections",
      "text": "Check your Risk of Ruin percentage and review the 100-trade geometric growth chart to visually assess your potential compounding trajectory."
    }
  ]
}
</script>